     M 64 64 L 64 82 L 68 84\n      M 68 64 L 72 80 L 76 80\n      M 70 48 L 78 44\n    `,\n    authorNote: \'Stylized geometric forest deer from Sahyadri folklore.\',\n  },\n\n  // MADHUBANI & FOLK\n  {\n    id: \'madhubani-peacock\',\n    name: \'Mayur (Royal Peacock)\',\n    category: \'madhubani\',\n    viewBox: \'0 0 100 100\',\n    svgPath: `\n      M 30 45 C 25 35, 35 20, 48 20 C 56 20, 60 26, 56 32 C 52 38, 45 42, 45 52\n      C 45 68, 62 76, 75 65 C 85 55, 88 35, 78 22 C 75 18, 80 16, 84 20\n      C 94 34, 92 64, 76 78 C 58 92, 35 85, 30 68 C 28 62, 28 50, 30 45 Z\n      M 54 24 A 2 2 0 1 1 53.9 24 Z\n      M 56 22 L 62 14 M 58 24 L 66 18 M 59 26 L 68 24\n      M 44 26 L 38 27\n      M 42 62 C 55 60, 68 50, 68 38\n      M 45 70 C 60 70, 75 60, 76 46\n    `,\n    authorNote: \'The national bird Mayura represents grace, joy, and monsoon beauty in Mithila paintings.\',\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'madhubani-fish\',\n    name: \'Matsya (Sacred Fish)\',\n    category: \'madhubani\',\n    viewBox: \'0 0 100 100\',\n    svgPath: `\n      M 15 50 C 35 25, 65 25, 85 50 C 65 75, 35 75, 15 50 Z\n      M 85 50 L 96 36 L 90 50 L 96 64 Z\n      M 32 37 C 38 43, 38 57, 32 63\n      M 24 45 A 2.5 2.5 0 1 1 23.9 45 Z\n      M 45 33 C 50 42, 50 58, 45 67\n      M 57 32 C 62 42, 62 58, 57 68\n      M 68 36 C 72 43, 72 57, 68 64\n      M 50 30 L 50 20 L 58 30\n      M 50 70 L 50 80 L 58 70\n    `,\n    authorNote: \'Fish in Madhubani art symbolises fertility, luck, and holy water bodies.\',\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'lotus-padma\',\n    name: \'Padma (Sacred Lotus)\',\n    category: \'symbol\',\n    viewBox: \'0 0 100 100\',\n    svgPath: `\n      M 50 20 C 44 32, 44 48, 50 65 C 56 48, 56 32, 50 20 Z\n      M 50 65 C 38 60, 24 45, 25 32 C 34 35, 42 48, 50 65 Z\n      M 50 65 C 62 60, 76 45, 75 32 C 66 35, 58 48, 50 65 Z\n      M 50 65 C 32 68, 14 58, 10 46 C 22 46, 36 56, 50 65 Z\n      M 50 65 C 68 68, 86 58, 90 46 C 78 46, 64 56, 50 65 Z\n      M 25 68 C 35 76, 65 76, 75 68 C 65 72, 35 72, 25 68 Z\n    `,\n    authorNote: \'Divine purity and wisdom, rising unblemished like the Indian national flower.\',\n  },\n\n  // FESTIVALS & SYMBOLS\n  {\n    id: \'diwali-diya\',\n    name: \'Deepam (Diwali Diya)\',\n    category: \'festival\',\n    viewBox: \'0 0 100 100\',\n    svgPath: `\n      M 50 15 C 44 26, 44 36, 50 44 C 56 36, 56 26, 50 15 Z\n      M 16 54 C 18 76, 82 76, 84 54 C 84 48, 16 48, 16 54 Z\n      M 14 52 L 86 52 C 86 56, 14 56, 14 52 Z\n      M 32 72 L 28 82 L 72 82 L 68 72 Z\n      M 50 26 C 48 30, 48 36, 50 38 C 52 36, 52 30, 50 26 Z\n    `,\n    authorNote: \'The clay lamp radiating inner light over darkness during Deepawali.\',\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'ashoka-chakra\',\n    name: \'Ashoka Chakra\',\n    category: \'symbol\',\n    viewBox: \'0 0 100 100\',\n    svgPath: `\n      M 50 12 A 38 38 0 1 1 49.9 12 Z\n      M 50 16 A 34 34 0 1 0 50.1 16 Z\n      M 50 42 A 8 8 0 1 1 49.9 42 Z\n      M 50 16 L 50 42 M 50 58 L 50 84\n      M 16 50 L 42 50 M 58 50 L 84 50\n      M 26 26 L 44 44 M 56 56 L 74 74\n      M 26 74 L 44 56 M 56 44 L 74 26\n      M 37 19 L 46 43 M 54 57 L 63 81\n      M 19 37 L 43 46 M 57 54 L 81 63\n      M 19 63 L 43 54 M 57 46 L 81 37\n      M 37 81 L 46 57 M 54 43 L 63 19\n    `,\n    authorNote: \'The 24-spoke wheel of righteousness and duty from Sarnath Lion Capital.\',\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'kalash-pot\',\n    name: \'Mangal Kalash\',\n    category: \'symbol\',\n    viewBox: \'0 0 100 100\',\n    svgPath: `\n      M 26 50 C 20 62, 22 76, 32 84 C 42 90, 58 90, 68 84 C 78 76, 80 62, 74 50 Z\n      M 30 50 L 70 50 L 66 44 L 34 44 Z\n      M 50 16 L 38 38 L 62 38 Z\n      M 34 44 C 24 38, 20 28, 26 24 C 32 28, 36 36, 38 42\n      M 66 44 C 76 38, 80 28, 74 24 C 68 28, 64 36, 62 42\n      M 40 60 L 60 74 M 60 60 L 40 74\n    `,\n    authorNote: \'Auspicious copper pot with fresh coconut and mango leaves for Pujas.\',\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'paisley-kalka\',\n    name: \'Kalka (Paisley Motif)\',\n    category: \'rangoli\',\n    viewBox: \'0 0 100 100\',\n    svgPath: `\n      M 48 88 C 26 88, 16 68, 22 46 C 28 26, 50 14, 62 10 C 66 8, 72 10, 68 16\n      C 60 26, 52 38, 62 48 C 72 58, 82 54, 82 66 C 82 80, 68 88, 48 88 Z\n      M 48 76 C 36 76, 30 64, 34 50 C 38 36, 50 26, 56 22\n      C 52 30, 48 38, 54 46 C 60 52, 68 50, 68 60 C 68 70, 60 76, 48 76 Z\n    `,\n    authorNote: \'Timeless mango leaf droplet pattern cherished in Kashmiri shawls and bridal mehndi.\',\n  },\n\n  // MONUMENTS & HERITAGE\n  {\n    id: \'india-gate\',\n    name: \'India Gate Monument\',\n    category: \'monument\',\n    viewBox: \'0 0 100 100\',\n    svgPath: `\n      M 16 88 L 84 88 L 84 84 L 16 84 Z\n      M 20 84 L 20 40 L 26 40 L 26 84 Z\n      M 74 84 L 74 40 L 80 40 L 80 84 Z\n      M 26 84 L 36 84 L 36 54 C 36 44, 64 44, 64 54 L 64 84 L 74 84\n      M 18 40 L 82 40 L 82 34 L 18 34 Z\n      M 22 34 L 78 34 L 78 24 L 22 24 Z\n      M 26 24 L 74 24 L 74 20 L 26 20 Z\n      M 40 20 L 60 20 L 60 17 L 40 17 Z\n    `,\n    authorNote: \'The towering arch memorial in the heart of New Delhi.\',\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'taj-dome\',\n    name: \'Taj Mahal Dome Silhouette\',\n    category: \'monument\',\n    viewBox: \'0 0 100 100\',\n    svgPath: `\n      M 50 10 L 50 18\n      M 50 18 C 38 24, 30 36, 32 48 L 68 48 C 70 36, 62 24, 50 18 Z\n      M 28 48 L 72 48 L 72 54 L 28 54 Z\n      M 24 54 L 76 54 L 76 84 L 24 84 Z\n      M 40 84 L 40 64 C 40 58, 60 58, 60 64 L 60 84 Z\n      M 12 84 L 16 84 L 15 36 L 13 36 Z\n      M 84 84 L 88 84 L 87 36 L 85 36 Z\n      M 8 84 L 92 84 L 92 88 L 8 88 Z\n    `,\n    authorNote: \'Graceful marble dome and minarets of Agra, symbol of everlasting love.\',\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'royal-elephant\',\n    name: \'Gajraj (Royal Elephant)\',\n    category: \'symbol\',\n    viewBox: \'0 0 100 100\',\n    svgPath: `\n      M 30 68 L 30 84 L 38 84 L 38 68\n      M 44 68 L 44 84 L 52 84 L 52 68\n      M 62 68 L 62 84 L 70 84 L 70 68\n      M 76 68 L 76 84 L 82 84 L 82 68\n      M 30 68 C 24 64, 20 54, 24 44 C 28 34, 40 32, 54 32\n      C 66 32, 78 36, 84 46 C 88 52, 88 64, 82 68 Z\n      M 26 44 C 18 46, 12 56, 12 70 C 12 76, 18 78, 18 74 C 18 64, 22 56, 26 52\n      M 32 40 A 2 2 0 1 1 31.9 40 Z\n      M 46 22 L 64 22 L 68 32 L 42 32 Z\n      M 55 16 L 55 22\n    `,\n    authorNote: \'Auspicious elephant adorned with howdah, representing Ganesha, power, and wisdom.\',\n  },\n];\n"
