  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing The Components**\n\nI\'m now focusing on building the individual components. The `Header.tsx` is underway, and I\'m planning out the Canvas India logo with its tricolor and lotus emblem. I\'m also addressing the project title, template selection, undo/redo buttons, and the \"clear canvas\" functionality. The undo/redo buttons need to show disabled states, and the title can be edited inline or cleared via a badge.\n\n\n**Expanding The Toolbar**\n\nI\'ve moved on to fleshing out the toolbar. I\'m prioritizing the sound toggle, fullscreen/zoom controls, and the export/download button with several formats (PNG, JPG, SVG, Copy, Print). I\'m planning a floating responsive toolbar, and I\'m designing specific tools like Pen, Brush, Calligraphy, Highlighter, Spray, Eraser, and Radial Symmetry. I\'m also addressing Shapes, Cultural Stamps, and a Text tool with Indian fonts. I will also incorporate an India Map backdrop toggle.\n\n\n**Refining The Modules**\n\nI\'m now iterating on the module designs. I\'m incorporating hex/color input, stroke width and opacity sliders with visual previews. I\'m also addressing the Radial Symmetry control with segment selectors and guidelines, as well as the Stamp Picker with category filtering and previews. The Template Modal will feature art templates, and the Export Modal includes resolution selection and download options. I\'m focusing on high-performance canvas with smoothing and DPI scaling.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 8
      nanos: 733486044
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
